#: ../../source/kv_cache_management/lookup.rst:4
msgid "Lookup the KV cache"
msgstr "查找 KV 缓存"

#: ../../source/kv_cache_management/lookup.rst:6
msgid "The ``lookup`` interface is defined as the following:"
msgstr "``lookup`` 接口定义如下："

#: ../../source/kv_cache_management/lookup.rst:12
msgid ""
"The function takes a list of tokens as input and returns event_id and a "
"dictionary containing the layout information for each token. The layout "
"information is represented as a mapping between ``instance_id`` and a "
"tuple of ``(location, matched_prefix_length)``."
msgstr "该函数接受 token 列表作为输入，并返回 event_id 和包含每个 token 布局信息的字典。布局信息表示为 ``instance_id`` 和 ``(location, matched_prefix_length)`` 元组之间的映射。"

#: ../../source/kv_cache_management/lookup.rst:16
msgid "Example usage:"
msgstr "使用示例："

#: ../../source/kv_cache_management/lookup.rst:18
msgid ""
"First, we need a yaml file ``example.yaml`` to properly configure the "
"lmcache instance:"
msgstr "首先，我们需要一个 yaml 文件 ``example.yaml`` 来正确配置 lmcache 实例："

#: ../../source/kv_cache_management/lookup.rst:36
msgid "Second, we need to start the vllm/lmcache instance at port 8000:"
msgstr "其次，我们需要在端口 8000 启动 vllm/lmcache 实例："

#: ../../source/kv_cache_management/lookup.rst:42
msgid ""
"Third, we need to start the lmcache controller at port 9000 and the "
"monitor at port 9001:"
msgstr "第三，我们需要在端口 9000 启动 lmcache 控制器，在端口 9001 启动监控器："

#: ../../source/kv_cache_management/lookup.rst:48
msgid "Then we can send a request to vllm to see if it works properly:"
msgstr "然后我们可以向 vllm 发送请求来查看它是否正常工作："

#: ../../source/kv_cache_management/lookup.rst:60
msgid "Now we send a request to tokenize the prompt:"
msgstr "现在我们发送请求来对提示进行 token 化："

#: ../../source/kv_cache_management/lookup.rst:71
msgid "We should be able to see token ids in response:"
msgstr "我们应该能够在响应中看到 token id："

#: ../../source/kv_cache_management/lookup.rst:77
msgid "Finally, we can send a ``lookup`` request to the lmcache controller:"
msgstr "最后，我们可以向 lmcache 控制器发送 ``lookup`` 请求："

#: ../../source/kv_cache_management/lookup.rst:87
msgid "We should be able to see the response like this:"
msgstr "我们应该能够看到类似这样的响应："

#: ../../source/kv_cache_management/lookup.rst:93
msgid ""
"The field ``lmcache_default_instance`` shows the instance ID, followed by"
" a tuple of ``(location, matched_prefix_length)`` indicating the cache "
"location within that instance and matched prefix length. ``event_id`` is "
"an identifier of the controller operation and can typically be ignored."
msgstr "字段 ``lmcache_default_instance`` 显示实例 ID，后跟 ``(location, matched_prefix_length)`` 元组，表示该实例内的缓存位置和匹配的前缀长度。``event_id`` 是控制器操作的标识符，通常可以忽略。"

